    <string id="bar_smart_terrain_1_stalker_bad_hunter_break_dialog_0">
        <text>See you.</text>
    </string>
    <string id="bar_smart_terrain_1_stalker_bad_hunter_find_the_family_gun_quest_dialog_0">
        <text>What happened?</text>
    </string>
    <string id="bar_smart_terrain_1_stalker_bad_hunter_find_the_family_gun_quest_dialog_1">
        <text>Damn it, I lost my family rifle in the Wild Territory. Thought I'd shoot some bloodsuckers, but barely escaped with my life. Damn! Listen, brother, if you bring my rifle back, I'll thank you. I earned a little bit here, I'll give it all to you, just return the rifle. It's a family heirloom, passed from father to son. And here I am—lost it. I practically grew attached to it, became kin, and now this mess.</text>
    </string>
    <string id="bar_smart_terrain_1_stalker_bad_hunter_find_the_family_gun_quest_dialog_2">
        <text>Alright, I'll try to get the rifle.</text>
    </string>
    <string id="bar_smart_terrain_1_stalker_bad_hunter_find_the_family_gun_quest_dialog_3">
        <text>I'll give you everything, friend, just return the rifle, I beg you. I lost it near the bloodsucker lair, I'll send you the coordinates of the place now. And be careful there, those beasts are very vicious.</text>
    </string>
    <string id="bar_smart_terrain_1_stalker_bad_hunter_find_the_family_gun_quest_dialog_4">
        <text>We'll see.</text>
    </string>
    <string id="bar_smart_terrain_1_stalker_bad_hunter_find_the_family_gun_quest_idle_dialog_0">
        <text>About your rifle...</text>
    </string>
    <string id="bar_smart_terrain_1_stalker_bad_hunter_find_the_family_gun_quest_idle_dialog_1">
        <text>Hello. Any news? Found it???</text>
    </string>
    <string id="bar_smart_terrain_1_stalker_bad_hunter_find_the_family_gun_quest_idle_dialog_2">
        <text>Found it, here's your rifle.</text>
    </string>
    <string id="bar_smart_terrain_1_stalker_bad_hunter_find_the_family_gun_quest_idle_dialog_3">
        <text>No. I have more important things to do right now.</text>
    </string>
    <string id="bar_smart_terrain_1_stalker_bad_hunter_find_the_family_gun_quest_idle_dialog_4">
        <text>What? Found the rifle? Wow!!! Brother, bro, bruv... I just have no words. Thank you. THANK YOU, damn it! Eh, you really helped, you really helped!!! Yesss! Here, take my humble reward, it's all I have. Sorry it's not as big as your help. And I won't forget, damn me, how you helped me. Hope I can help you the same way in time. Thank you. Listen, I'll tell you something. Next to the place where you got my rifle, there's another thing, a strange boarded-up house. Nobody knows what's in there, but through the windows you can see there are a lot of anomalies. Maybe there are artifacts too, only I don't know how to get in there.</text>
    </string>
    <string id="bar_smart_terrain_1_stalker_bad_hunter_find_the_family_gun_quest_idle_dialog_5">
        <text>It's up to you, but I hope you change your mind.</text>
    </string>
    <string id="bar_smart_terrain_1_stalker_bad_hunter_find_the_family_gun_quest_idle_dialog_6">
        <text>See you.</text>
    </string>
    <string id="bar_smart_terrain_1_stalker_bad_hunter_start_dialog_0">
        <text>Eh... if only someone would help...</text>
    </string>
